type(scope): NOVA-XXX description

# Types:
#   feat     (new feature)
#   fix      (bug fix)
#   docs     (documentation changes)
#   style    (formatting, missing semicolons, etc; no code change)
#   refactor (refactoring production code)
#   test     (adding missing tests, refactoring tests)
#   chore    (updating grunt tasks etc; no production code change)
#
# Scope:
#   The component or area affected (e.g., core, agent, state, etc.)
#
# NOVA-XXX:
#   The Jira ticket reference
#
# Description:
#   Clear, concise description of the changes
#
# Body (optional):
# - Detailed explanation if needed
# - Breaking changes should start with BREAKING CHANGE:
# - Include motivation and context
#
# Footer (optional):
# - Reference related issues: Fixes #123, Relates to #456
# - Note breaking changes: BREAKING CHANGE: description
#
# Example:
# feat(agent): NOVA-123 add graph execution monitoring
#
# Implements real-time monitoring for graph execution with the following features:
# - Node execution timing
# - Edge traversal metrics
# - State persistence tracking
#
# BREAKING CHANGE: monitoring API endpoints now require authentication
# Relates to #789
